msgid "&Add..."
msgstr "&Östäw..."

#. i18n: file bgadvanced_ui.ui line 50
#: rc.cpp:9 rc.cpp:265
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<p>Click here if you want to add a program to the listbox. This button opens a "
"dialog where you are asked to give details about the program you want to run. "
"To successfully add a program, you must know if it is compatible, the name of "
"the executable file and, if necessary, its options.</p>\n"
"<p>You usually can get the available options to a suitable program by typing in "
"a terminal emulator the name of the executable file plus --help (foobar "
"--help).</p>\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
"<p>Yazılımnı tezmägä östäw öçen monda çirtäse. Eşlätäse kilgän yazılım turında "
"belem kürsätüçe täräzäne bu töymä aşa açıp bula. Yazılımnı uñışlı östäw öçen, "
"anıñ monda eşli aluın, eşçañ biremeneñ adın, kiräk bulsa, anıñ köylämälären "
"belü kiräk.</p>\n"
"<p>Ğädättägeçä yaraqlı yazılımnıñ mömkin bulğan köylämälären, terminal "
"täräzäsendä eşçän birem adına --help östäp belep bula (ü.ö. foobar --help).</p>"
"\n"
"</qt>"

#. i18n: file bgadvanced_ui.ui line 64
#: rc.cpp:18 rc.cpp:274
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click here to remove programs from this list. Please note that it does not "
"remove the program from your system, it only removes it from the available "
"options in the background drawing programs list."
msgstr ""
"Yazılımnı tezmädän alıp taşlaw öçen monda çirtäse. Monıñ yazılımnı "
"sistemağızdan alıp taşlamawın isäpkä alığız, ul anı asyaq süräten yasaw "
"yazılımnarınıñ mömkin bulğan saylanmaları isemlegennän genä alıp taşlí."

#. i18n: file bgadvanced_ui.ui line 75
#: rc.cpp:21 rc.cpp:277
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Modify..."
msgstr "&Üzgärtü..."

#. i18n: file bgadvanced_ui.ui line 81
#: rc.cpp:24 rc.cpp:280
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<p>Click here to modify the programs options. You usually can get the available "
"options to a suitable program by typing in a terminal emulator the name of the "
"executable file plus --help. (example: kwebdesktop --help).</p>\n"
"<p>One useful example is the program kwebdesktop. It draws a web page on the "
"background of your desktop.  You can use this program by selecting it on the "
"listbox on the right, but it will draw a predefined web page. To change the web "
"page it renders, select the kwebdesktop program on the listbox, then click "
"here. A dialog will appear, allowing you to change the web page by replacing "
"the old address (URL) with a new one.</p>\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
"<p>Yazılım köylämälären üzgärtü öçen monda çirtäse. Ğädättägeçä yaraqlı "
"yazılımnıñ mömkin bulğan köylämälären, terminal täräzäsendä eşçän birem adına "
"--help östäp belep bula (ü.ö. kwebdesktop -help)</p>\n"
"<p>kwebdesktop yazılımı öçen ber faydalı ürnäk. Ul östäl asyağına web bit sala. "
"Bu yazılımnı sez uñdağı isemlektän saylap qullana alasız, läkin ul aldan "
"birelgän web biten salaçaq. Anıñ web biten alıştırır öçen başta isemlektän "
"kwebdesktop yazılımın saylağız da, monda çirtegez. İske adresnı (URL) yañağa "
"üzgärtep web biten alıştırırğa mömkinlek birä torğan dialog açılır,</p>\n"
"</qt>"

#. i18n: file bgadvanced_ui.ui line 104
#: rc.cpp:30 rc.cpp:286
#, no-c-format
msgid "Program"
msgstr "Yazılım"

#. i18n: file bgadvanced_ui.ui line 115
#: rc.cpp:33 rc.cpp:289
#, no-c-format
msgid "Comment"
msgstr "Açıqlama"

#. i18n: file bgadvanced_ui.ui line 126
#: rc.cpp:36 rc.cpp:292
#, no-c-format
msgid "Refresh"
msgstr "Yañart"

#. i18n: file bgadvanced_ui.ui line 156
#: rc.cpp:39 rc.cpp:295
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<p>Select from this listbox the program you want to use to draw your desktop "
"background.</p>\n"
"<p>The <b>Program</b> column shows the name of the program."
"<br>\n"
"The <b>Comment</b> column brings a short description."
"<br>\n"
"The <b>Refresh</b> column indicates the time interval between redraws of the "
"desktop.</p>\n"
"<p>The <b>K Web Desktop</b> program (kwebdesktop) is worth noting: it draws a "
"specified page of the web in your desktop. You can modify it, and the webpage "
"it draws by selecting it here, then clicking on the <b>Modify</b> button."
"<br>\n"
"You can also add new compliant programs. To do that, click on the <b>Add</b> "
"button."
"<br>\n"
"You can also remove programs from this list clicking on the <b>Remove</b> "
"button. Please note that it does not remove the program from your system, it "
"only removes it from the available options in this listbox.</p>\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
"<p>Eş östäleneñ artyağın salu öçen faydalanırğa telägän yazılımnı isemlektän "
"saylağız.</p>\n"
"<p>Yazılımnıñ adı <b>Yazılım</b> buyında."
"<br>\n"
"<b>Açıqlama</b> buyında qısqaça añlatma."
"<br>\n"
"<b>Yañartu</b> buyı eş östälen yañadan salğan arada uzğan waqıt arasın "
"kürsätä.</p>\n"
"<p> <b>K Web Östäle</b> atlı yazılımı (kwebdesktop) berni tormıy: ul "
"kürsätelgän web yazılımın eş östälegezgä sala. Anı häm ul sala torğan web biten "
"monnan saylap, annarı <b>Üzgärtü</b> töymäsenä çirtep üzgärtä alasız."
"<br>\n"
"Tıñlawçanraq yaña yazılımnar da östi alasız. Monıñ öçen <b>Östäw</b> "
"töymäsenä basığız."
"<br>\n"
"Yazılımlarnı <b>Alıp taşlaw</b> töymäsenä basıp alıp taşlıy da alasız.. Monıñ "
"yazılımnı sistemığızdan alıp taşlamawın istä totığız, ul anı bu isemlekneñ "
"mömkin bulğan saylanmalarınnan ğına alıp taşlıy.</p>\n"
"</qt>"

